<section class="wrap page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">STORIES, ONE AT A TIME</p><h1>日常<span class="rose-word">慢慢画。</span></h1><p>从一个小念头开始，画到一个不太按计划的结尾。</p></section>
<section class="wrap archive-list"><% page.posts.sort('date',-1).each(function(post){ %><article class="archive-card"><a class="archive-cover" href="<%= url_for(post.path) %>"><img src="<%= url_for(post.cover || '/images/autumn-terrace/04-640.webp') %>" width="1122" height="1402" loading="lazy" alt="<%= post.title %>漫画封面"></a><div><span class="pill">生活漫画</span><time><%= date(post.date,'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time><h2><a href="<%= url_for(post.path) %>"><%= post.title %></a></h2><p><%= post.description || strip_html(post.excerpt || '').slice(0,140) %></p><a class="text-link" href="<%= url_for(post.path) %>">展开这个故事 →</a></div></article><% }); %></section>
<% if(page.total > 1){ %><nav class="pagination wrap" aria-label="故事列表分页"><%- paginator({prev_text:'上一页',next_text:'下一页'}) %></nav><% } %>
